WEBVTT

00:00.959 --> 00:02.335
[dramatic music playing]

00:02.419 --> 00:03.795
[man] Hey, fucker.

00:07.382 --> 00:08.550
Who was it?

00:11.136 --> 00:12.554
[sighs]

00:16.641 --> 00:17.600
Hey.

00:20.645 --> 00:22.147
Didn't I tell ya

00:22.897 --> 00:24.983
not to fuck around while you're working?

00:28.319 --> 00:29.779
I mean, what the hell?

00:33.742 --> 00:34.743
I apologize.

00:36.953 --> 00:37.954
Hey.

00:39.164 --> 00:43.418
[sighs] Seok-dae oppa's cousin
said someone beat him up,

00:44.044 --> 00:45.003
so we went to help.

00:45.086 --> 00:47.547
You decided to help,
and you got your ass kicked?

00:48.631 --> 00:50.800
- I wouldn't exactly say he got his ass…
- [man] Shut up.

00:59.476 --> 01:00.935
- Okay.
- [stubs out cigarette]

01:02.604 --> 01:03.563
[grunts softly]

01:03.646 --> 01:05.148
Let's make them pay for it.

01:05.648 --> 01:07.108
Hmm? [grunts]

01:07.692 --> 01:08.818
[Seok-dae grunts]

01:09.611 --> 01:10.820
There you go!

01:12.280 --> 01:13.698
[Seok-dae grunts]

01:15.116 --> 01:19.454
[chuckles] Hey. We'll split it.
Yeah? I'll give you half.

01:19.954 --> 01:21.664
- [grunting]
- [Seok-dae whimpers]

01:25.585 --> 01:27.587
Ah! [laughs]

01:27.670 --> 01:28.546
- [grunts]
- [crunch]

01:29.839 --> 01:31.841
["Hero" by Meego playing]

01:46.773 --> 01:51.903
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

02:46.666 --> 02:48.168
[Su-ho] Look what hyeong's about to do.

02:50.044 --> 02:52.714
- [Beom-seok] Oh!
- [Su-ho] Okay! Mark ten points.

02:56.134 --> 02:58.428
We should be studying
for our assessment, right?

03:02.348 --> 03:03.474
Yeah, you're right.

03:04.475 --> 03:05.518
[Su-ho] Si-eun-ssi.

03:06.019 --> 03:07.687
Bro, it's the weekend, yeah?

03:07.770 --> 03:10.815
We need to let our blood circulate
so our brains can function better.

03:10.899 --> 03:12.650
We need to have a little fun
once in a while.

03:12.734 --> 03:14.027
- [balls clatter]
- [sighs]

03:15.445 --> 03:17.071
You're not going to college?

03:17.155 --> 03:18.531
Man, almost.

03:19.824 --> 03:23.036
Climbing back into hell? Huh?
Are you literally insane?

03:24.037 --> 03:25.288
Get up. Your turn.

03:25.371 --> 03:27.081
[boys in background groan]

03:28.374 --> 03:31.669
Get up and play. Don't play hard to get!

03:31.753 --> 03:33.296
- [chuckles]
- [Su-ho] Aah! This guy.

03:34.047 --> 03:35.381
[Si-eun sighs]

03:36.758 --> 03:37.926
[Su-ho] Aah.

03:42.222 --> 03:43.723
[Si-eun] Reflection principle.

03:43.806 --> 03:46.142
The incident angle
and the reflection angle are the same

03:46.226 --> 03:48.186
from the center of the billiard ball.

03:48.269 --> 03:52.065
Incident angle, 35 degrees.
Margin of error, within three degrees.

03:52.148 --> 03:54.400
Probability of success, 90%.

04:01.783 --> 04:03.243
- [Beom-seok] Oh!
- [laughs]

04:04.035 --> 04:05.203
[Si-eun] Let's go study.

04:10.625 --> 04:12.835
Where are you going? We play three rounds.

04:13.336 --> 04:15.255
A hundred points to start off. Okay?

04:15.338 --> 04:17.507
[boys in background cheer and laugh]

04:19.550 --> 04:21.302
I think it'll be the same result.

04:21.886 --> 04:23.054
Ah, shit.

04:23.888 --> 04:26.975
You think so? Huh?
You think it'll be the same?

04:27.058 --> 04:29.644
Let's bet on jjajangmyeon and tangsuyuk.

04:29.727 --> 04:32.480
No wait, gochu japchae. Are you in, bro?

04:33.147 --> 04:34.357
[boys in background whoop]

04:34.440 --> 04:35.608
[sighs]

04:42.490 --> 04:43.700
[Su-ho] Come on!

04:45.827 --> 04:46.911
[sighs]

04:48.121 --> 04:49.622
You know I went easy on you.

04:50.415 --> 04:53.293
- No, you didn't.
- Agh, I feel so miserable. Shit.

04:53.876 --> 04:55.920
Whatever. Let's grab a beer.

04:57.005 --> 04:59.007
I'm leaving. Go ahead.

05:00.174 --> 05:02.760
Why? Let's go together. I got it.

05:02.844 --> 05:04.929
You guys already put me behind schedule.

05:05.638 --> 05:08.391
All right. Get home safe. It'll be us two.

05:09.517 --> 05:12.478
You got lucky today, man.
Next time, I won't go easy on you.

05:15.815 --> 05:20.069
- So, um, where should we go grab drinks?
- Hey, come on. Hurry up, follow me.

05:22.572 --> 05:24.574
[PA chiming]

05:25.325 --> 05:27.118
[man 1] Ma'am. Ma'am, please.

05:27.201 --> 05:29.203
[muffled announcement on PA]

05:33.207 --> 05:34.417
[man 2] Check that box, please.

05:37.587 --> 05:38.838
[man 2] That's correct.

05:38.921 --> 05:41.007
Hyeong, what's with your arm?

05:44.344 --> 05:45.845
[man 3] What do you think?

05:46.346 --> 05:48.473
It's all your fault, little hyeong.

05:48.973 --> 05:50.641
[menacing music playing]

05:51.517 --> 05:52.352
What?

05:54.520 --> 05:55.646
Who are you?

05:56.272 --> 05:58.524
[man 3 chuckles]
That's none of your business.

05:59.233 --> 06:01.069
But I need you to do me a favor.

06:07.950 --> 06:09.786
[upbeat pop music playing]

06:32.975 --> 06:34.894
Fuck. What the hell's he doing here?

06:34.977 --> 06:36.521
I'm fucked. [gasps]

06:38.022 --> 06:40.233
[assistant 1] Can I help you
find something? Oh…

06:41.192 --> 06:42.819
[assistant 2] It's 13,000 won.

06:43.528 --> 06:46.489
Oppa, you almost done?
They don't have what I want.

06:46.572 --> 06:49.325
- [assistant 2] Thank you.
- [Yeong-i] Hurry up, I'm hungry.

06:49.409 --> 06:50.535
Thanks a lot!

06:51.202 --> 06:52.245
Let's go.

06:56.207 --> 06:59.001
[gasps] What? It's pouring rain out here.

07:00.837 --> 07:03.756
Ah, man. Why's it raining so much?

07:04.382 --> 07:05.299
Wait a sec!

07:09.720 --> 07:11.347
I don't have an umbrella.

07:13.307 --> 07:14.225
Uh…

07:15.852 --> 07:18.604
- Walk me home. It's pouring.
- Why should I?

07:18.688 --> 07:20.898
[Yeong-i] Because you have
an umbrella and I don't.

07:20.982 --> 07:22.650
- Do you like tteokbokki?
- [Si-eun] No.

07:22.733 --> 07:25.111
[Yeong-i] Oh. I know
a great tteokbokki place over there.

07:25.194 --> 07:26.612
It'll change your mind.

07:28.030 --> 07:29.365
[Yeong-i] Mmm.

07:29.449 --> 07:30.783
It's really spicy.

07:31.534 --> 07:32.660
[quirky music playing]

07:33.453 --> 07:34.412
[Si-eun] Hey.

07:36.038 --> 07:38.541
- Is it all right if I leave?
- No, you can't leave.

07:40.042 --> 07:42.336
- Why not?
- I don't like to eat when I'm alone.

07:42.879 --> 07:44.005
[sighs]

07:44.797 --> 07:46.591
Why aren't you eating? Too spicy?

07:47.633 --> 07:49.469
- Why would you eat this?
- [chuckles]

07:50.052 --> 07:51.721
You don't have any friends, huh?

07:54.557 --> 07:55.600
[phone bleeps]

07:55.683 --> 07:57.351
- [ringing tone]
- [phone buzzing]

07:58.019 --> 07:59.812
That's my number. Save it.

07:59.896 --> 08:01.063
What's your name?

08:02.773 --> 08:03.774
Why?

08:04.609 --> 08:05.610
[sighs]

08:06.277 --> 08:07.153
ASSHOLE

08:07.236 --> 08:10.781
[sighs] Because you seem
like a selfish and rude asshole.

08:11.699 --> 08:13.910
Guys like you are kinda my style.

08:16.746 --> 08:18.372
Thank you for the food!

08:19.081 --> 08:20.500
[phone ringing]

08:23.753 --> 08:25.588
[Yeong-i] I'm gonna go. See you later.

08:25.671 --> 08:26.797
Sorry about before.

08:29.258 --> 08:30.510
Yeah, I'm coming.

08:31.093 --> 08:32.261
I'm heading over now.

08:33.304 --> 08:34.180
Uh-huh.

08:34.263 --> 08:35.973
- [insects chirping]
- [dog barking]

08:40.311 --> 08:41.771
[car doors close]

08:44.857 --> 08:47.276
- Where's Yeong-i?
- [boy 1] On her way back.

08:49.779 --> 08:51.656
- [video game gunfire]
- Go, you shit!

08:51.739 --> 08:54.116
- Gil-su hyeung inside?
- Uh-huh.

08:56.035 --> 08:56.953
[boy 2] Nice work.

08:57.036 --> 09:00.206
[chuckles] Hey.
This crazy kid brought his mom's car.

09:00.289 --> 09:01.624
- [all laugh]
- [boy 2] Idiot.

09:01.707 --> 09:03.334
- [boy 3] Awesome.
- [boy 5] Out of his mind.

09:05.169 --> 09:06.837
Hey, fuckin' asshole.

09:07.421 --> 09:09.590
I told you
not to ignore my calls, didn't I?

09:09.674 --> 09:10.675
[menacing music playing]

09:10.758 --> 09:12.802
- I'm sorry.
- You're sorry?

09:15.012 --> 09:16.639
What are you going to do to pay me back?

09:19.559 --> 09:21.143
I'll get it from my mom.

09:22.019 --> 09:23.145
[Gil-su sighs]

09:24.146 --> 09:25.565
I'll give you three days.

09:26.065 --> 09:27.984
If you don't have the money by then,

09:28.818 --> 09:31.779
your shitty parents will
be fucking dead, you got it?

09:31.862 --> 09:34.532
Huh? And I'll burn your house down too.

09:35.908 --> 09:37.243
[clinking]

09:42.707 --> 09:43.833
[Gil-su sighs]

09:44.375 --> 09:45.334
Did it go well?

09:45.918 --> 09:46.877
Yes.

09:48.212 --> 09:49.880
Whoa. Good job.

09:51.841 --> 09:53.384
That little bastard.

09:53.467 --> 09:57.096
Hey, will you beat him up for, like,
30 minutes before kicking him out?

09:58.055 --> 09:59.724
Or you can just stab him.

10:01.058 --> 10:02.310
[chuckles]

10:07.064 --> 10:08.065
[sighs]

10:10.484 --> 10:11.485
[boys chatting]

10:11.569 --> 10:13.863
- [boy 1] …study that…
- [boy 2] Yeah. Let's go.

10:13.946 --> 10:15.448
[boy 1] …hard time sleeping, as well…

10:15.990 --> 10:16.907
[boy 3] I don't sleep.

10:16.991 --> 10:18.868
[boy 1] Think I'm gonna
prepare for the test.

10:19.577 --> 10:22.371
- [boy 3] Class was rough today.
- [boy 4] Yeah. I did have a good time.

10:22.455 --> 10:23.956
- [Beom-seok] It's coming.
- [Su-ho] Look.

10:24.040 --> 10:26.584
- [Beom-seok] The thunder.
- [Su-ho] I see it. Right there. Ah!

10:26.667 --> 10:29.086
- Wait, I'm gonna do this one.
- [boy 3] …it smells great. Girls…

10:29.170 --> 10:32.298
- [Beom-seok] Su-ho-ya, the car.
- [Su-ho] Oh, yeah, the car. Get in.

10:32.381 --> 10:35.551
- [Beom-seok] That the only one?
- Oh, here. I'll take this one instead.

10:35.635 --> 10:37.845
- I want that one.
- Take the other one.

10:37.928 --> 10:38.929
- Yeon Si-eun.
- [Su-ho] Hey.

10:44.185 --> 10:45.936
[Yeong-bin] Can I talk to you
for a minute?

10:47.897 --> 10:49.357
I don't have anything to say.

10:49.857 --> 10:51.484
Hey, what do you want now?

10:56.781 --> 10:57.907
I'll be real quick.

11:03.204 --> 11:05.539
- [yawns loudly]
- Please help me out here.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.794
Will you meet with my attorney just once?

11:10.586 --> 11:12.296
All you have to do is just

11:12.922 --> 11:14.507
tell him that it wasn't my fentanyl.

11:14.590 --> 11:15.925
[yawns]

11:17.343 --> 11:18.886
[Yeong-bin] Beom-seok, you too.

11:22.390 --> 11:25.601
[sighs] I'm the only reason
that my mom wakes up in the morning.

11:28.479 --> 11:29.605
[sighs] Please help me.

11:30.189 --> 11:32.441
Or else I'll end up
going to a reformatory.

11:32.525 --> 11:33.943
[sighing]

11:34.777 --> 11:37.071
[Su-ho] This crying act
isn't fooling anybody.

11:37.154 --> 11:39.615
- [Yeong-bin sobbing]
- Si-eun-a.

11:41.075 --> 11:42.702
Shall we just make a statement?

11:43.494 --> 11:45.162
It wouldn't be that hard.

11:57.091 --> 11:58.050
[sighs]

12:13.399 --> 12:14.483
[Su-ho groans]

12:17.987 --> 12:18.821
Hey.

12:19.572 --> 12:20.906
Why are you going to the basement?

12:20.990 --> 12:22.616
Oh, it's a shortcut.

12:24.618 --> 12:26.120
I'll kill you if you're lying.

12:26.662 --> 12:27.872
I'm not lying.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.126
[Su-ho] Hey, hurry up.

12:32.918 --> 12:34.712
[Su-ho groans] What should
we eat for dinner?

12:34.795 --> 12:36.297
[Si-eun] I'm going to the hagwon.

12:36.380 --> 12:39.175
[Su-ho] Come on! You always say that.

12:39.675 --> 12:43.137
Let's go get a bowl of jjajangmyeon
and go to the internet café later.

12:43.220 --> 12:45.055
It's okay for you to skip work today?

12:45.139 --> 12:47.391
Oh. Do I have work? Darn it.

12:51.520 --> 12:52.605
[menacing music plays]

12:52.688 --> 12:54.523
[Su-ho sighs] Guess I won't make it.

12:59.653 --> 13:00.821
[sighs]

13:01.781 --> 13:02.990
I expected this.

13:04.533 --> 13:07.286
[Gil-su] Hey, little hyeongs.
Nice to meet ya.

13:11.999 --> 13:12.875
[sighs]

13:15.419 --> 13:16.712
[sighs]

13:25.721 --> 13:27.723
Seok-dae-ya, was it them?

13:29.642 --> 13:30.643
Yes.

13:31.894 --> 13:33.103
[sighs]

13:34.814 --> 13:36.649
Well, as you may know,

13:36.732 --> 13:40.694
my dear Seok-dae had to go
to the hospital because of you.

13:41.362 --> 13:43.739
- I mean, he doesn't even have insurance.
- [paper rustles]

13:43.823 --> 13:46.617
Hmm? How could you beat him up like that?

13:47.243 --> 13:48.410
What is it you want?

13:50.329 --> 13:52.081
[Gil-su] I'll give you three days.

13:53.249 --> 13:55.292
Bring 15 million won to me.

13:56.252 --> 13:57.169
[scoffs]

13:58.087 --> 13:59.880
That's bullshit. Hey.

13:59.964 --> 14:01.382
What's up with the cast?

14:01.882 --> 14:03.425
I never touched your arm, man.

14:03.509 --> 14:07.221
You don't even remember
break-break-breaking his arm like this?

14:07.304 --> 14:08.430
You little piece of shit.

14:08.514 --> 14:09.390
[Si-eun] But

14:10.975 --> 14:12.476
do you have evidence that it was us?

14:14.353 --> 14:15.604
Wow!

14:15.688 --> 14:17.147
[laughs]

14:18.107 --> 14:21.652
Man, these little hyeongs are
freakin' wild.

14:21.735 --> 14:22.653
Hey.

14:23.279 --> 14:24.321
[sighs]

14:25.114 --> 14:27.032
I kill people for less money.

14:28.325 --> 14:30.160
Sometimes I'll break a limb if I want.

14:30.244 --> 14:32.746
Bragging about that is childish.

14:32.830 --> 14:33.998
This motherfucker…

14:35.291 --> 14:36.292
[inhales]

14:37.251 --> 14:38.252
[exhales]

14:39.795 --> 14:40.921
Are you kidding?

14:42.423 --> 14:43.340
[scoffs]

14:44.341 --> 14:45.718
I'll give you three days.

14:47.177 --> 14:49.054
If you don't bring me my money,

14:50.180 --> 14:51.932
you'll be borrowing it from me then.

14:52.016 --> 14:52.892
[laughs]

14:54.184 --> 14:57.229
- [Su-ho yelps]
- [laughs] You rude little prick.

14:58.230 --> 15:00.524
- [knife clicks]
- [Gil-su laughs]

15:00.608 --> 15:01.650
Let's go.

15:10.618 --> 15:12.453
[engines revving]

15:12.536 --> 15:15.456
- [tires screeching]
- [horns honking]

15:24.214 --> 15:25.466
Are you okay, Su-ho-ya?

15:27.676 --> 15:29.553
- [Su-ho] Not at all. Fuck.
- [Beom-seok] Hold on.

15:29.637 --> 15:30.512
[Su-ho] Okay.

15:31.263 --> 15:32.640
[groans]

15:32.723 --> 15:34.391
- [Beom-seok] What do we do?
- [Su-ho sighs]

15:34.975 --> 15:37.645
They can't do anything. Ow, shit.

15:41.357 --> 15:43.692
I don't know why it's not starting.
They said it'd run.

15:43.776 --> 15:45.361
- [boy 1] Hey, yeah.
- [ringing tone]

15:50.324 --> 15:51.450
Kids are coming out.

15:53.077 --> 15:55.079
[tense music playing]

15:58.082 --> 15:59.625
[boy 2] Who is this? All right.

16:00.125 --> 16:01.460
[boy 3 spits]

16:05.339 --> 16:06.507
[laughs]

16:06.590 --> 16:09.677
- I'll go with you when you go.
- I'll look over it again.

16:17.101 --> 16:18.018
[boy 4] Is that him?

16:20.145 --> 16:21.146
Hey.

16:27.403 --> 16:28.988
[boy 5] We're just hanging out.

16:29.738 --> 16:31.991
[boy 6] Yeah, I could
really eat something.

16:32.074 --> 16:33.450
[boy 5] What's he lookin' at?

16:33.534 --> 16:35.911
- [coughs]
- [laughs] Yeah.

16:36.745 --> 16:38.747
[tense music continues]

16:47.006 --> 16:49.008
[horn beeping]

16:51.593 --> 16:52.720
[lock bleeps]

16:59.518 --> 17:00.853
[music fades]

17:04.606 --> 17:05.649
[phone bleeps]

17:05.733 --> 17:06.984
[ringing tone]

17:09.653 --> 17:10.779
[Yeong-i] Hello?

17:11.405 --> 17:12.823
Let's meet somewhere.

17:20.414 --> 17:22.041
- [door opens]
- [shop bell rings]

17:25.085 --> 17:27.087
[muzak playing]

17:37.014 --> 17:39.308
[sighs] That guy.

17:39.391 --> 17:40.684
What does he do?

17:41.185 --> 17:42.186
Who?

17:44.938 --> 17:45.981
Oh.

17:47.024 --> 17:48.192
Gil-su?

17:49.485 --> 17:50.319
[smacks lips]

17:50.402 --> 17:53.989
[sighs] That guy lets us crash
and gives us a job.

17:55.032 --> 17:57.409
- What kind?
- [Yeong-i] You know, this and that.

17:58.660 --> 17:59.912
Why do you care?

18:04.166 --> 18:05.167
[sighs]

18:06.251 --> 18:07.961
I shouldn't be saying this.

18:11.381 --> 18:13.801
Just watch your back 'cause he's trash.

18:14.426 --> 18:15.302
[tense music playing]

18:15.385 --> 18:18.472
[Yeong-i] He wasn't lying when he said
he killed people for money.

18:19.556 --> 18:22.142
He has gangster connections. Real ones.

18:23.936 --> 18:26.522
He's money-crazy. He's not even human.

18:27.689 --> 18:28.524
So what?

18:28.607 --> 18:31.360
Give him whatever money you have,
even if it's half.

18:32.111 --> 18:33.362
[Si-eun] Otherwise?

18:34.530 --> 18:36.115
What happens if I don't?

18:37.908 --> 18:38.784
[sighs]

18:42.496 --> 18:43.664
You're fucked.

18:46.333 --> 18:48.460
You'll be fucked like the rest of us.

18:57.594 --> 18:58.720
Will it be done?

19:00.139 --> 19:01.181
[Yeong-i] What?

19:04.059 --> 19:05.102
If he gets paid?

19:10.983 --> 19:12.734
- [Yeong-i] Hmm.
- Will you be okay?

19:18.657 --> 19:20.033
[music stops]

19:23.620 --> 19:25.164
[suspenseful music playing]

19:50.898 --> 19:52.649
[quiet clattering]

20:05.287 --> 20:06.830
[exhales]

20:14.129 --> 20:15.631
[Su-ho yawns]

20:17.007 --> 20:18.800
Why? What's going on?

20:19.927 --> 20:20.928
What is it?

20:22.429 --> 20:24.640
Man, I'm hungry. Ugh.

20:27.142 --> 20:29.519
CHEMISTRY LAB

20:32.189 --> 20:33.398
[Su-ho yawns]

20:34.441 --> 20:37.236
[sighs] I'll do it. I'll take care of it.

20:39.112 --> 20:41.406
- Hmm?
- It's been three days.

20:42.741 --> 20:44.368
[unzips bag]

20:46.995 --> 20:48.247
Fifteen million won.

20:50.582 --> 20:52.376
Once he has it, it'll end.

20:54.670 --> 20:55.712
[Su-ho] What's this?

20:57.130 --> 20:59.091
Um, it's from my parents.

20:59.174 --> 21:01.134
Are you kidding me? Huh?

21:01.635 --> 21:03.762
Your parents just gave you this?

21:04.513 --> 21:05.389
Where'd you get it?

21:06.598 --> 21:09.893
- Why does that even that matter?
- [Su-ho] Where'd you get it?

21:11.603 --> 21:12.604
Where's it from?

21:16.024 --> 21:17.442
I sold my father's watch.

21:17.943 --> 21:20.654
He was handing it down to me anyway, so…

21:20.737 --> 21:22.990
What an idiot. Huh?

21:23.991 --> 21:26.743
Why give money to that asshole?
We can just call the police.

21:26.827 --> 21:27.869
[sighs]

21:29.079 --> 21:31.498
Take this and get your watch back.

21:32.749 --> 21:35.335
They told us that going to the police
wouldn't do us any good.

21:36.378 --> 21:37.629
Beom-seok-a.

21:39.256 --> 21:40.590
Thanks a lot.

21:41.341 --> 21:43.719
But I'll handle it. Don't worry about it.

21:43.802 --> 21:46.221
[Su-ho] How the hell
are you gonna handle it?

21:46.305 --> 21:47.681
Let's just report it.

21:47.764 --> 21:50.058
Yeah, I'm gonna do that.

21:57.941 --> 22:00.902
That asshole makes
runaway kids do jobs for him.

22:02.029 --> 22:03.405
PROMISSORY NOTE

22:03.488 --> 22:06.491
Do you know about Free Money?
It's popular with high school kids.

22:07.951 --> 22:10.537
- What? What's that?
- A gambling site.

22:11.121 --> 22:14.333
It gives you 50,000 won as soon
as you join, so it's called Free Money.

22:15.876 --> 22:18.211
Gil-su's partner runs it overseas.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.172
Everything's rigged.

22:20.922 --> 22:22.466
They let you win the first few rounds.

22:22.549 --> 22:24.634
You end up making tens of millions of won.

22:24.718 --> 22:27.429
- False hope. They let you keep winning.
- [phone chimes]

22:28.388 --> 22:32.100
That's when it happens.
You begin to lose everything that you won.

22:33.310 --> 22:35.395
- [sad sound effect]
- [Yeong-i] Nothing is chance.

22:35.896 --> 22:39.524
Their balance of tens of millions of won
suddenly drops to zero.

22:39.608 --> 22:41.151
They go nuts.

22:42.736 --> 22:45.697
So they keep gambling,
trying to win back what they lost.

22:46.198 --> 22:49.785
But how do they keep gambling?
They lost their money.

22:49.868 --> 22:50.702
[bleep]

22:53.580 --> 22:55.415
[Yeong-i] Gil-su has
membership information,

22:55.499 --> 22:58.001
so he approaches them
and offers a private loan.

23:01.129 --> 23:03.882
All these kids obviously
can't repay the debt they owe,

23:04.800 --> 23:06.176
so they bring collateral.

23:06.843 --> 23:09.429
A few days ago,
someone even brought their mom's car.

23:11.306 --> 23:14.726
He basically makes the kids steal money
and stuff from their parents.

23:16.144 --> 23:19.648
[Si-eun] Then he takes out private loans
using the kids' bank accounts.

23:20.357 --> 23:22.567
He makes them do dead drops for drugs.

23:22.651 --> 23:25.946
Gets them involved in crimes,
keeping them trapped.

23:27.572 --> 23:30.742
Their housing has ledgers,
contracts, even illegal drugs.

23:30.826 --> 23:33.120
All we need to do is bring
the police over there.

23:33.912 --> 23:34.913
[Beom-seok sighs]

23:36.289 --> 23:37.791
How'd you know about all that?

23:39.418 --> 23:40.752
Did you Google it?

23:44.172 --> 23:46.508
Uh, I… just know.

23:47.968 --> 23:48.885
[sighs]

23:50.387 --> 23:53.849
[Su-ho] Well, let's do Si-eun's great plan
right after we get something to eat.

23:53.932 --> 23:57.060
Okay? I'm so hungry, I could die!

23:59.729 --> 24:01.189
[menacing music playing]

24:05.735 --> 24:07.195
Hey, one sec.

24:10.907 --> 24:11.908
[Si-eun] Why?

24:15.954 --> 24:18.123
I'll, um… go by myself.

24:19.374 --> 24:20.333
What?

24:22.252 --> 24:25.922
Hey, like you said, if the ledgers
and drugs are at their place,

24:26.006 --> 24:28.800
office, or whatever,
we have to bring the police over there.

24:29.801 --> 24:31.511
Yeah. I'll call them right now.

24:31.595 --> 24:35.140
No, dude. You have to catch them there.
Photos won't do any good.

24:36.850 --> 24:39.811
So I'll go there first
and send you the address.

24:40.479 --> 24:43.273
Come with the police. I'll stall for time.

24:43.356 --> 24:45.442
Hey, you can't go by yourself.

24:46.860 --> 24:50.280
I'm still the toughest guy
at Byuksan High. You don't trust me?

24:51.448 --> 24:54.034
It's all right, 'kay? Bye.

24:57.704 --> 24:58.872
[sighs]

24:59.498 --> 25:02.083
[boy 1] Yeah, I think
I'm maybe gonna ask her out tonight.

25:05.045 --> 25:05.921
[Gil-su] Hey!

25:06.963 --> 25:08.757
You Three Musketeers disbanded?

25:10.926 --> 25:13.595
[Su-ho] Hey, we're not
a bunch of dicks like you.

25:13.678 --> 25:14.888
We only need one.

25:14.971 --> 25:18.225
[sighs] Stop talking shit
and hand it over. Right now.

25:19.351 --> 25:20.727
Before I do that,

25:21.895 --> 25:23.188
let's have a word, man to man.

25:23.271 --> 25:24.689
God… [splutters]

25:26.775 --> 25:28.026
You don't have it, do you?

25:28.818 --> 25:30.028
[chuckles]

25:31.029 --> 25:32.906
I have something better. Hmm?

25:34.115 --> 25:35.867
[sighs] I mean, here's the thing.

25:36.576 --> 25:39.913
Hyeong, I'm the top dog in this school.

25:41.873 --> 25:43.875
There's a way I can help you out here.

25:43.959 --> 25:46.920
That gambling website of yours
can make a lot more money.

25:47.003 --> 25:48.547
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

25:50.882 --> 25:51.967
How'd you know that?

25:56.137 --> 25:57.222
Him.

25:57.847 --> 25:59.432
His cousin is in my class.

25:59.933 --> 26:02.644
- He showed me the website before.
- Aah.

26:02.727 --> 26:04.187
- [Su-ho] Mm-hmm.
- Aah.

26:07.315 --> 26:10.151
Everybody gets a voucher
for 50,000 won when they join.

26:10.986 --> 26:15.532
Instead of giving them just one,
let's do at max three vouchers per person.

26:16.199 --> 26:18.243
Then, implement a referral system.

26:19.536 --> 26:22.205
Pretty soon, the whole school
will be a gambling den.

26:24.249 --> 26:27.669
I'm sure you have an office or whatever.
Let's go there, have coffee, and talk.

26:27.752 --> 26:29.170
- [Gil-su sighs]
- How's that?

26:34.593 --> 26:36.595
[laughs]

26:39.514 --> 26:41.558
This little hyeong's ambitious.

26:41.641 --> 26:44.269
[sighs] Okay, hop in.

26:44.352 --> 26:45.979
Hey, take the wheel.

26:46.062 --> 26:47.647
- [boy 1] Sure, hyeong.
- [Yeong-i] Oppa.

26:50.233 --> 26:53.903
Should we wait up for the other two
and take them with us, just in case?

26:57.115 --> 26:58.158
Yeah, sure.

26:59.409 --> 27:02.329
Seong-chan, get in.
The youngest is coming with me.

27:05.582 --> 27:06.625
Move it.

27:08.126 --> 27:10.086
- [car door slides open]
- [Yeong-i sighs]

27:11.046 --> 27:12.881
[Su-ho] Oh!

27:13.632 --> 27:14.883
[sighs]

27:15.550 --> 27:16.468
[boy 2 grunts]

27:19.971 --> 27:21.264
[chuckles]

27:21.348 --> 27:22.682
[Su-ho exhales]

27:22.766 --> 27:24.142
[engine starts]

27:34.027 --> 27:35.403
What's that about?

27:35.487 --> 27:36.988
[gasps]

27:41.242 --> 27:42.077
Hold on a minute.

27:44.871 --> 27:48.208
- [Si-eun] They went to your place, right?
- Uh-huh. Why's he going there alone?

27:48.291 --> 27:50.710
- You're not reporting from here?
- We'll bring the police there.

27:50.794 --> 27:52.212
- What's the address?
- [Yeong-i sighs]

27:52.295 --> 27:54.923
17-1 Sanggye-ro, Nowon-gu, Seoul.

27:55.006 --> 27:57.050
It's a single-family house
with blue gates.

27:57.133 --> 27:59.260
17-1 SANGGYE, NOWON, SEOUL
HOUSE WITH BLUE DOOR

28:07.060 --> 28:09.187
[Beom-seok] Hey, taxi. Taxi!

28:14.567 --> 28:15.735
[watch buzzes]

28:18.154 --> 28:20.657
SI-EUN: IF THE ADDRESS IS RIGHT
TEXT ANYTHING BACK

28:25.036 --> 28:26.955
[Si-eun] Hey, hey. What are you doing?

28:27.038 --> 28:28.331
[sighs]

28:28.415 --> 28:30.792
Everything's gonna be okay
once I bring the money to him.

28:30.875 --> 28:32.752
Why's Su-ho going there alone?

28:32.836 --> 28:34.045
That guy's crazy.

28:34.838 --> 28:37.173
What are we gonna do?
What if something happens?

28:39.676 --> 28:41.803
Please go to 17-1 Sanggye-ro, Nowon-gu.

28:54.315 --> 28:55.483
[sighs]

28:55.567 --> 28:56.526
[Seok-dae] Yeong-a.

28:57.444 --> 28:58.528
What are you doing?

29:00.196 --> 29:01.197
[Yeong-i sighs]

29:03.074 --> 29:03.908
[sighs]

29:05.201 --> 29:07.078
Trying to make sure Gil-su goes to prison.

29:07.162 --> 29:08.204
What?

29:09.998 --> 29:12.333
He's gonna bring the police
over to our place.

29:17.297 --> 29:19.215
If we keep going like this,

29:20.341 --> 29:22.886
we're gonna be stuck
in this kind of life forever.

29:24.387 --> 29:26.097
You don't want that either, right?

29:36.566 --> 29:37.901
[Su-ho sighs]

29:39.903 --> 29:42.197
Stay here for a little bit, okay? Huh?

29:42.280 --> 29:43.782
Yeah, no problem.

29:45.241 --> 29:46.201
[car door opens]

29:47.202 --> 29:48.745
- [Su-ho] Aah.
- [car door slams]

29:51.414 --> 29:52.957
[ominous music playing]

29:57.962 --> 29:59.214
[Su-ho sighs]

30:03.676 --> 30:06.221
Wow, that's a pretty house.

30:07.013 --> 30:09.015
Blue gates. Hmm.

30:09.724 --> 30:11.142
That's cobalt blue, right?

30:13.436 --> 30:14.521
How pretty.

30:20.860 --> 30:21.986
[Gil-su] Let's go.

30:24.489 --> 30:26.491
[tense music playing]

30:34.374 --> 30:35.250
[Gil-su sighs]

30:38.503 --> 30:40.505
[distant sirens blaring]

30:42.799 --> 30:43.883
[Gil-su sighs]

30:44.509 --> 30:45.426
[Su-ho sighs]

30:46.594 --> 30:48.346
Sit over there. Sit. [chuckles]

30:49.389 --> 30:50.390
[gate closes]

30:50.473 --> 30:52.267
Ah, I like your place.

30:52.350 --> 30:54.060
- I'm into retro.
- [Gil-su chuckles]

30:54.143 --> 30:55.270
Something to drink?

30:55.854 --> 30:58.606
I'd be grateful with
just a cup of water or something.

30:59.232 --> 31:00.233
[Gil-su] Water?

31:03.528 --> 31:05.530
Hey, give your phone to me.

31:10.326 --> 31:13.538
- Why?
- Ah, I just want to make sure.

31:13.621 --> 31:15.498
This, this, this, here.

31:15.582 --> 31:17.917
I want to find out if you've
been using it or not.

31:18.001 --> 31:22.797
I'm the type who's very sensitive
about personal information.

31:22.881 --> 31:24.132
[laughs]

31:25.216 --> 31:26.551
I can't work with you like that.

31:27.135 --> 31:29.053
[both laughing loudly]

31:29.929 --> 31:31.306
I see, yeah.

31:33.349 --> 31:35.894
Well, you leave me no choice.

31:36.603 --> 31:37.729
- [Su-ho grunts]
- Aah!

31:37.812 --> 31:39.397
- [Su-ho groans]
- Give it to me.

31:40.857 --> 31:44.569
Goddamn it, son of a bitch! Deceive me?

31:45.069 --> 31:48.948
- Fucking son of a bitch! [yells]
- [Su-ho grunting]

31:49.032 --> 31:49.949
Whew.

31:50.825 --> 31:52.952
- [bat clatters to floor]
- [Gil-su] Give me his phone.

31:54.913 --> 31:55.955
[sighs]

32:00.877 --> 32:03.421
[sighs] "I'm on my way with the police?"

32:04.172 --> 32:05.089
[sighs]

32:05.173 --> 32:08.009
[Su-ho] Wow, that's a pretty house.

32:08.092 --> 32:09.260
Blue gates.

32:09.344 --> 32:11.638
[laughs] Hey. Hey!

32:12.305 --> 32:13.723
What the hell is this?

32:13.806 --> 32:16.517
[scoffs] I thought you'd come
with your punk friends,

32:16.601 --> 32:19.062
but you called the fucking cops,
you asshole!

32:19.145 --> 32:20.355
[puffing]

32:21.022 --> 32:23.942
Hey, call Seok-dae, that motherfucker.

32:25.568 --> 32:26.611
All of you, come with me.

32:31.532 --> 32:33.034
[tires screech]

32:55.765 --> 32:56.766
[breathing shakily]

33:01.813 --> 33:03.398
[shuffling footsteps]

33:15.660 --> 33:17.704
Hey, are you here alone?

33:18.955 --> 33:21.582
Yes. Well, I uh, brought the…

33:24.168 --> 33:25.878
I'm here to give you the money.

33:27.088 --> 33:29.090
Let my friend go first,
then I'll give it to you.

33:29.173 --> 33:31.384
Are you trying to trick me,
you little shit?

33:31.467 --> 33:32.635
You son of a bitch. Follow me.

33:32.719 --> 33:34.721
[siren blaring]

33:42.729 --> 33:43.980
[tires squeal]

33:45.231 --> 33:46.149
[siren stops]

33:46.232 --> 33:48.109
[man sighs] This isn't even
our jurisdiction.

33:49.360 --> 33:50.445
[bell rings]

33:55.116 --> 33:56.117
[bleeping]

33:56.200 --> 33:58.494
- [man on radio] What is your status?
- Is anybody here?

33:59.203 --> 34:00.872
[banging on gate]

34:01.873 --> 34:03.124
Anyone?

34:03.624 --> 34:05.251
- [radio bleeps]
- Hey, kid.

34:05.334 --> 34:07.545
- [man] On the premises yet?
- You sure this is it?

34:07.628 --> 34:08.546
Yes.

34:12.050 --> 34:12.925
[bleeping]

34:13.009 --> 34:14.844
- What now?
- [man] What is your status?

34:15.595 --> 34:16.637
- Units en route.
- Ahem.

34:16.721 --> 34:18.890
We can't, um, really do anything, right?

34:20.224 --> 34:22.185
[cop 1] Well, we should head out.

34:22.977 --> 34:24.687
Next time, come to the station.

34:25.605 --> 34:26.439
[Si-eun] What?

34:27.106 --> 34:29.275
[cop 2] We didn't come here
with a search warrant.

34:30.485 --> 34:32.862
There's no evidence at all,
just a few photographs.

34:33.362 --> 34:36.616
[cop 1] We'll still hand over those photos
to the Violent Crimes Unit.

34:36.699 --> 34:39.368
Come by the station to give
your statement sometime.

34:39.869 --> 34:42.455
- And pick up your phone when we call.
- [cop 2 sighs]

34:49.170 --> 34:51.964
[car doors open and shut]

34:52.840 --> 34:54.217
[engine starts]

34:55.051 --> 34:56.844
[car pulls away]

35:11.901 --> 35:13.903
[suspenseful music playing]

35:59.699 --> 36:01.576
[glass crunching]

36:22.513 --> 36:23.764
[gasps]

36:29.896 --> 36:31.606
AHN SU-HO

36:31.689 --> 36:33.191
[ringing tone]

36:39.363 --> 36:41.365
[ringing tone continues]

36:43.701 --> 36:46.871
[Yeong-i] There's a room where
he keeps all the illegal property.

36:51.876 --> 36:53.502
[ringing tone continues]

36:55.213 --> 36:57.882
[Yeong-i] All the ledgers and drugs
should be in the safe.

37:03.179 --> 37:06.015
[robotic voice] Your call
cannot be completed as dialed.

37:06.098 --> 37:08.309
Please leave a message after the tone.

37:10.394 --> 37:12.396
[suspenseful music continues]

37:26.994 --> 37:28.996
["Brass Knuckle" by Boi B playing]

37:36.545 --> 37:37.588
♪ Kick it ♪

37:39.090 --> 37:41.801
♪ Yo, brass knuckle, do the damn, uh ♪

37:42.885 --> 37:44.595
♪ Yo, yo… ♪

37:45.721 --> 37:47.807
[lyrics in Korean]

37:59.443 --> 38:00.528
♪ You never know… ♪

38:00.611 --> 38:02.613
[lyrics in Korean]

38:17.461 --> 38:18.337
♪ Knock, knock… ♪

38:18.421 --> 38:20.339
[lyrics in Korean]

38:26.345 --> 38:28.764
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

38:28.848 --> 38:31.183
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

38:31.267 --> 38:33.936
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing… ♪

38:34.020 --> 38:35.938
[lyrics in Korean]

38:36.022 --> 38:38.691
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

38:38.774 --> 38:41.110
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

38:41.193 --> 38:43.529
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

38:43.612 --> 38:46.157
♪ Good boy gone bad… ♪

38:46.240 --> 38:47.325
[lyrics in Korean]

38:49.452 --> 38:51.120
♪ But I got K2 in my mouth… ♪

38:51.203 --> 38:53.205
[lyrics in Korean]

38:57.918 --> 38:59.086
♪ Break your fuckin' neck… ♪

38:59.170 --> 39:00.796
[lyrics in Korean]

39:05.051 --> 39:06.510
♪ Yo, smells like teen spirit… ♪

39:06.594 --> 39:08.679
[lyrics in Korean]

39:15.853 --> 39:16.771
♪ Brass knuckle… ♪

39:16.854 --> 39:18.939
[lyrics in Korean]

39:24.862 --> 39:28.199
♪ But you don't hear me, though
Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

39:28.282 --> 39:30.659
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

39:30.743 --> 39:33.454
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing… ♪

39:33.537 --> 39:35.581
[lyrics in Korean]

39:35.664 --> 39:38.084
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

39:38.167 --> 39:40.461
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

39:40.544 --> 39:43.047
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

39:43.130 --> 39:45.716
♪ Good boy gone bad ♪

39:51.931 --> 39:53.599
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS
ARE FICTIONAL

39:53.682 --> 39:55.309
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
